<td colspan="3"><strong>Observational Notes:</strong> You'll be seeing a supernova in a few millennia. Wouldn't it be funny if that's where it was, at long last? I hear voices. I know it can't be them, because there is nothing here. This is a flaw in my interface. That's all I really need. <em>Researcher's Note: This is the last transmission related to the Khevtuul 1 mission, prior to the probe going offline.</em></td>
